# ===== Mammoth project .gitignore =====
# This repo versions SCRIPTS and small reproducibility METADATA only.
# All large data is downloaded or regenerable — do not track it.

# --- Bioinformatics data: never track (huge, downloaded, or regenerable) ---
# Genome assemblies, STAR/Salmon/bowtie2 indexes, annotations, fastqs and
# pipeline outputs all live under Genome/. Recreate them with the download
# and build scripts. The few small "how-to-reproduce" files are added
# explicitly with:  git add -f <path>
/Genome/

# --- Nextflow scratch (anywhere in the tree) ---
work/
.nextflow/
.nextflow.log*
.nf/

# --- Logs / temp ---
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp
*~

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
